      "name": "Row — 12.13.7 · Curator onboarding (GDHUB-74)",
      "width": 300,
      "height": 240,
      "content": "13.7 · Curator onboarding (GDHUB-74)\n\nCurator: Advisor settings → Paid work → Project curation, in place on S5YkC — switch + their own stages; one curator status.\n13.7a admin: Checkpoints → Curators tab — approve the person; Decline / Revoke.\n13.7b admin: Decline / Revoke with a short note (Popover).\n13.7c the curator status: approved, not approved (fragment of S5YkC).\n\nSpec: docs/design/specs/checkpoint-curator-onboarding.md"
